WEBVTT

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:07.170
Damn, this is it, Daley!

00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:08.370
A little bit more.

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:10.270
Now!

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:27.350
Did we get it?

00:00:39.570 --> 00:00:40.470
Damn...

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:48.410
What? Why?! The core is gone.

00:00:57.560 --> 00:00:59.820
Nene! Nene!

00:01:01.530 --> 00:01:02.430
I'm going!

00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:05.100
But you won't have any support.

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:08.260
Nigel, where is the battery metal in this suit?

00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:11.540
I arranged it to be decentralized within the body.

00:01:11.540 --> 00:01:13.640
It's fully charged.

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:16.730
Why didn't you make mine first?!

00:01:22.780 --> 00:01:24.110
What's going on?

00:01:24.780 --> 00:01:29.090
I guess the boomer's evolved
to the point it can move

00:01:29.090 --> 00:01:30.920
without being controlled by the core.

00:01:31.790 --> 00:01:34.420
Don't talk about it as if it's a living thing!

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:39.860
What?

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:41.770
I see!

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:43.600
I understand.

00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:46.710
The load from the Skyhook, has
disturbed the Dragon Line!

00:01:46.710 --> 00:01:48.110
I guess so.

00:01:55.450 --> 00:01:59.710
It's dragging the Dragon Line!
That's why it's immortal, isn't it?

00:02:06.190 --> 00:02:07.520
What's going on?

00:02:15.470 --> 00:02:16.330
Linna?!

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:19.270
Linna!

00:02:20.370 --> 00:02:22.880
Separate it from the Dragon Line,

00:02:22.880 --> 00:02:26.210
or it will revive again and again!

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:28.380
Thank you, Nene!

00:02:48.370 --> 00:02:51.030
I'm going to get one too!

00:03:14.830 --> 00:03:17.460
What are you doing, Galatea?

00:03:22.070 --> 00:03:24.590
Cut it out! Stop speaking in machine language!

00:03:25.440 --> 00:03:29.400
I want you to remember that I was
the one who rescued you.

00:03:30.240 --> 00:03:33.300
Please make my dream come true, Galatea.

00:03:33.850 --> 00:03:37.870
I want to see how you're going
to change the world.

00:03:39.720 --> 00:03:41.520
You want to be God, don't you?

00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:49.190
I see. I guess so.

00:03:50.300 --> 00:03:52.290
If what God does is just be there.

00:03:53.070 --> 00:03:55.970
The only reason to exist is to observe the end

00:03:55.970 --> 00:03:58.240
of the irrational living organisms that he created.

00:03:58.240 --> 00:04:00.430
Therefore, I'm God,

00:04:01.470 --> 00:04:04.970
and you have surpassed even God!

00:04:06.650 --> 00:04:08.010
Anti-seed...

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:14.350
In order to give metal living qualities,

00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:17.590
it was necessary to copy
traits from a human's.

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:22.100
Stingray implanted the seed that
became you into his daughter,

00:04:22.100 --> 00:04:24.400
and waited for the miracle of
an antibody to appear.

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:26.730
However, that was just a clue.

00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:29.370
You did it to your body.

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:35.400
I wanted to. I implanted a minor copy of you,

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:39.800
a boomer core, in my artificial
organs as a control factor.

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:43.780
I wanted to be the most advanced human being.

00:04:45.820 --> 00:04:47.750
Even though you're a human.

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:54.390
I don't understand why my sister
holds such a grudge against me.

00:04:57.930 --> 00:04:58.900
Galatea!

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:04.670
What the hell is this?!

00:05:04.670 --> 00:05:07.010
Galatea, what did you do?!

00:05:07.010 --> 00:05:08.630
What did you to my body?!

00:05:09.510 --> 00:05:10.770
Galatea!

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:22.720
Is it okay that it looks this big?

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:25.320
It needs to be this size for
someone to be able to wear it.

00:05:25.890 --> 00:05:28.860
This new suit looks ridiculous.

00:05:28.860 --> 00:05:31.460
But this is seriously incredible!

00:05:31.460 --> 00:05:35.330
Linna's already kicked the crap
out of that huge boomer!

00:05:36.300 --> 00:05:38.700
Yes, the new suits are incredible.

00:05:38.700 --> 00:05:41.010
However, when you wear it...

00:05:41.010 --> 00:05:42.380
When you wear it?

00:05:42.380 --> 00:05:43.640
Hey, Mackey?

00:05:44.380 --> 00:05:47.570
You'll do something about that soon, won't you?

00:05:49.650 --> 00:05:51.120
What? What is it?!

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:52.380
Well...

00:05:53.020 --> 00:05:54.550
Sure. I see.

00:05:54.550 --> 00:05:57.360
WHAT?! Without putting anything on?!

00:05:57.360 --> 00:05:58.650
No way!

00:06:00.390 --> 00:06:01.530
Where's Nigel?

00:06:01.530 --> 00:06:04.930
Sylia's here so they're talking, I guess.

00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:23.580
I've always appreciated you.

00:06:25.350 --> 00:06:30.050
I have served your father and
you for two generations.

00:06:32.290 --> 00:06:33.490
What do you mean?

00:06:34.190 --> 00:06:35.350
There's no meaning.

00:06:36.030 --> 00:06:39.020
Are you telling me that I've only been using you?

00:06:42.470 --> 00:06:43.660
Don't be ridiculous!

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:47.370
I haven't been working with you
just because I feel sorry for you!

00:06:47.370 --> 00:06:50.340
It's because I think your technology is superior.

00:06:52.380 --> 00:06:54.540
Then, what is it you wish?

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:57.680
Did you intend to live your life
dealing with a noisy vehicle,

00:06:57.680 --> 00:07:00.980
a relic from the last century,
just scattering gasoline?

00:07:02.920 --> 00:07:04.650
Don't make me laugh.

00:07:07.160 --> 00:07:08.320
I...

00:07:09.300 --> 00:07:10.160
I love...

00:07:10.160 --> 00:07:11.530
Ms. Sylia...

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:17.430
The hard suit based on the new
concept still utilizes your bio-data.

00:07:18.270 --> 00:07:22.230
Therefore, your hard suit has been
completed as the first model.

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:25.210
However, I don't want you to put it on.

00:07:26.610 --> 00:07:28.670
I guess you've reached the limit.

00:07:30.320 --> 00:07:35.310
The hard suit's feedback is too
much for a mature female like you.

00:07:41.090 --> 00:07:43.060
I'm glad you care about me.

00:08:34.810 --> 00:08:36.210
Galatea...

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:39.020
What did you do to me?

00:08:42.260 --> 00:08:44.160
You desire to be a God, don't you?

00:08:45.020 --> 00:08:48.230
You'll be able to stare at the
world forever from there.

00:08:48.230 --> 00:08:51.220
Stare at the world? What are you going to do?

00:08:52.000 --> 00:08:55.300
I'm going to let the underground earthworm out.

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:57.960
Impossible! You mean the Dragon Line?

00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:40.160
I'm too old to play with toys.

00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:22.050
I saw fire.

00:11:22.880 --> 00:11:24.510
Thank you.

00:11:26.750 --> 00:11:28.220
What are you laughing at?

00:11:29.050 --> 00:11:33.490
When we see each other, it seems
you always have a sexy outfit on.

00:11:36.100 --> 00:11:37.590
Don't you dare look!

00:11:47.040 --> 00:11:48.940
How's your wound?

00:11:48.940 --> 00:11:49.740
Okay.

00:11:50.280 --> 00:11:53.140
You usually put on heavy equipment.

00:11:53.680 --> 00:11:56.770
You look as if you try to seal
yourself in something.

00:12:00.250 --> 00:12:03.190
Well, I'm not trying to be a psychiatrist.

00:12:07.560 --> 00:12:09.200
Isn't there anybody left in town?

00:12:09.200 --> 00:12:11.960
No, Tokyo is closed.

00:12:12.570 --> 00:12:13.460
Closed?

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:16.490
For fear of the phenomenon
spreading through the city.

00:12:19.470 --> 00:12:20.500
Look at this.

00:12:23.940 --> 00:12:25.380
What the hell is this?

00:12:25.380 --> 00:12:27.480
The International Organization Army.

00:12:27.480 --> 00:12:29.780
Japan has been occupied by them.

00:12:30.550 --> 00:12:33.110
By boomers and by other countries.

00:12:47.930 --> 00:12:51.200
Leon, what are you going to do here?

00:13:07.490 --> 00:13:09.920
Priss, come to the pit now!

00:13:09.920 --> 00:13:11.990
I'm kind of...

00:13:11.990 --> 00:13:14.360
What? Is somebody there?

00:13:14.360 --> 00:13:18.260
Nobody! I just don't feel like coming over there.

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:19.930
You don't feel like...

00:13:20.670 --> 00:13:22.840
This is no time to talk like that!

00:13:22.840 --> 00:13:25.700
A monster! There's a monster!

00:13:37.120 --> 00:13:39.050
We don't have time to wait for Priss.

00:13:39.620 --> 00:13:42.020
Galatea must be trying to break
through the Tokyo blockade

00:13:42.020 --> 00:13:44.820
by making the Dragon Line come alive.

00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:48.260
We've got to stop her from playing this trick.

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:51.390
This is my first time to put on the suit, so...

00:13:52.970 --> 00:13:54.170
Mackey?

00:13:54.170 --> 00:13:55.500
Yes?

00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:57.900
Can you go somewhere else?

00:13:59.140 --> 00:14:00.300
Mackey...

00:14:01.340 --> 00:14:03.610
This room is for ladies only.

00:14:03.610 --> 00:14:05.770
Oh! Yes, that's right!

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:17.260
Where's your partner?

00:14:17.260 --> 00:14:19.190
I don't know, maybe at home.

00:14:21.890 --> 00:14:25.970
The AD Police has been dissolved.
We've been ordered to withdraw.

00:14:25.970 --> 00:14:27.930
Then why are you here?

00:14:27.930 --> 00:14:31.490
The same as you. You don't have a purpose
for fighting anymore, do you?

00:14:33.370 --> 00:14:35.970
There was no purpose from the beginning.

00:14:37.710 --> 00:14:41.080
Can you tell me the reason
why you hate boomers?

00:14:42.180 --> 00:14:44.550
I can't. It's embarrassing.

00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:45.850
Embarrassing?

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:48.120
Anyway, hurry up!

00:15:03.970 --> 00:15:05.800
Get into the hard suit.

00:15:27.390 --> 00:15:28.720
Now, start pouring.

00:15:29.260 --> 00:15:31.600
This makes me feel disgusting.

00:15:31.600 --> 00:15:33.090
Pour what?

00:15:34.930 --> 00:15:37.400
Yuck, what's this?!

00:15:37.400 --> 00:15:41.410
Inner metal. It will completely
envelop your body.

00:15:41.410 --> 00:15:43.280
This is so disgusting!

00:15:43.280 --> 00:15:44.870
It will set soon.

00:15:47.950 --> 00:15:49.650
Now, start.

00:15:49.650 --> 00:15:50.380
Nene!

00:15:50.380 --> 00:15:51.850
What?

00:15:51.850 --> 00:15:55.350
You need a charm to use the hard suit.

00:15:55.350 --> 00:15:57.690
A charm? What is it?

00:15:58.260 --> 00:16:00.560
Let the inner metal know what your command is.

00:16:01.190 --> 00:16:06.170
To do that, your brain has to change
your command into clear language.

00:16:06.170 --> 00:16:08.860
Nene, I was able to use the suit by thinking,

00:16:10.170 --> 00:16:13.540
"I want to be stronger and jump higher."

00:16:24.450 --> 00:16:25.710
Incredible!

00:16:26.320 --> 00:16:31.090
Me too! "I'm going to be an ultra
cool shining Knight Saber!"

00:16:39.930 --> 00:16:41.920
Knight Sabers! Action!

00:16:48.010 --> 00:16:50.380
Sylia and the others have left, haven't they?

00:16:50.380 --> 00:16:51.670
I tried to stop them.

00:16:52.680 --> 00:16:54.700
I wonder if I should have tried to stop them too?

00:16:55.750 --> 00:16:59.310
The result would be the same, so
it would have been wasted.

00:17:00.020 --> 00:17:00.990
Nigel!

00:17:01.850 --> 00:17:04.450
You'll keep helping Sylia, won't you?

00:17:06.060 --> 00:17:10.860
I... I think I probably won't be able
to stay close to Sylia for long.

00:17:10.860 --> 00:17:13.890
You didn't leave her even though
Mason asked you to.

00:17:14.670 --> 00:17:18.800
So, I think Sylia... Sylia, she's...

00:17:20.740 --> 00:17:22.300
Don't worry about it.

00:17:22.910 --> 00:17:26.400
I'll be the same person in the future as I'm now.

00:17:28.080 --> 00:17:30.450
My life seems to be like that.

00:17:33.450 --> 00:17:34.420
Priss!

00:17:42.030 --> 00:17:44.190
Mackey, I'm going too!

00:17:45.300 --> 00:17:47.090
How did you get a wound like that?

00:17:49.870 --> 00:17:51.670
I wonder if she's okay?

00:18:04.880 --> 00:18:07.020
What the hell is this?!

00:18:07.020 --> 00:18:08.510
Disgusting!

00:18:09.590 --> 00:18:11.820
The Dragon Line, has become
a semi-living thing,

00:18:11.820 --> 00:18:13.830
and is spreading the phenomenon all over.

00:18:13.830 --> 00:18:17.160
All underground equipment has
transformed into mad boomers.

00:18:24.900 --> 00:18:27.240
The Dragon?! It's that big?!

00:18:27.240 --> 00:18:30.980
Linna, you finished off a huge
boomer by yourself earlier!

00:18:30.980 --> 00:18:33.740
Now, there are three of us! We can do it!

00:19:04.010 --> 00:19:04.980
Nene!

00:19:04.980 --> 00:19:06.310
Yoo-hoo!

00:19:32.000 --> 00:19:33.470
Nice work, huh?

00:19:33.470 --> 00:19:34.230
Back off!

00:19:43.580 --> 00:19:44.550
No way.

00:19:56.460 --> 00:19:58.730
Do you want to become a living thing that badly?

00:20:02.700 --> 00:20:05.730
Do you want to cover the entire
world with boomers?!

00:20:06.340 --> 00:20:08.100
Galatea!

00:20:16.280 --> 00:20:17.980
No!

00:20:17.980 --> 00:20:18.750
Nene!

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:21.220
Nene!

00:20:25.460 --> 00:20:26.480
Linna!

00:20:31.360 --> 00:20:32.760
You're wounded...

00:20:33.700 --> 00:20:35.370
Don't worry, go ahead.

00:20:35.370 --> 00:20:36.560
I understand.

00:20:45.040 --> 00:20:46.670
Linna!

00:20:56.630 --> 00:20:59.920
Next Episode

00:21:01.190 --> 00:21:02.530
This feeling...

00:21:02.530 --> 00:21:06.300
I think I've had an experience like
this a long, long time ago.

00:21:06.300 --> 00:21:10.270
Momentary relief with my comrades,
overflowing with smiles.

00:21:10.270 --> 00:21:13.740
It was like a dream that we were
fighting together a little while ago.

00:21:13.740 --> 00:21:16.570
Anyway, cheers for now.

00:21:16.570 --> 00:21:17.540
But...

00:21:18.840 --> 00:21:21.250
We're surrounded by boomers!

00:21:21.250 --> 00:21:23.110
Next Bubblegum Crisis!
